Looking at this as the first round of an iterated game, I want to establish a foundation of trust and cooperation. By sending a substantial amount, I signal my willingness to cooperate, which could lead to mutually beneficial outcomes across multiple rounds.

If I send $4, it becomes $12 for the receiver. If they return a fair amount (like $6), we both end up better off than if we don't cooperate. This creates an opportunity for building trust over the remaining rounds.

